# DOI: A New Identifier for Digital Content.

**Authors:** Berinstein, Paula

## Abstract
Previews Digital Object Identifiers (DOIs), a potential unifying classification system for the Web and the Internet developed by the Association of American Publishers and the Corporation for National Research Initiatives. Discusses issues and problems surrounding DOI implementation and usage and how DOI would affect publishers, users, rights-holders. (Author/AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ559786

